{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach and take visible object, process it, move to target, or scan area otherwise. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectClose    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
